OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'gone'
OL,4,Abut pledges 'new era of leadership'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has warned
OL,7,Fthat the consensus on both science and
OL,8,Fclimate change has "gone".
OL,10,FAddressing other world leaders and
OL,11,Fdelegates at the COP31 climate summit
OL,12,Fin Turkey, he said that despite this,
OL,13,Fthe UK was ready to begin a "new era of
OL,14,FBritish leadership" on the climate
OL,15,Fchange issue.
OL,17,FBut environmental campaigners at the
OL,18,Fsummit said the PM had to back up his
OL,19,Fwarm words with stronger actions.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
