OL,3,ABurnham says climate consensus 'gone'
OL,4,Abut pledges 'new era of leadership'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn recent months, the UK government has
OL,7,Fannounced policies which critics say
OL,8,Fhave weakened its green credentials,
OL,9,Fsuch as reducing support for heat
OL,10,Fpumps, approving the Jackdaw gas field
OL,11,Fand doubling down on support for
OL,12,FHeathrow Airport's expansion.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
